    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Momento Pole, your movement is your greatest weapon.</strong> Master pole-swinging momentum to position yourself, escape swarms, and unleash devastating speed-powered attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget standing still. Every attack, every dodge, every kill is driven by how you move. Build speed to power up skills, grab poles to unleash charged abilities, and chain movement into deadly combos. With every run, experiment with unique skill combinations, talisman setups, and character momentum abilities that make no two battles alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/2e8a8ec4f361ecce64e45e473b8ee9e0.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/2e8a8ec4f361ecce64e45e473b8ee9e0.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/2e8a8ec4f361ecce64e45e473b8ee9e0.mp4?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement-Combat Fusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed isn\u2019t just for dodging \u2014 it\u2019s your ammo, your trigger, your damage multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/69ca2c7b2c538a87c437853cc2b3606d.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/69ca2c7b2c538a87c437853cc2b3606d.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/69ca2c7b2c538a87c437853cc2b3606d.mp4?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush enemies with the raw energy of Yokai Cores! Maintain your speed and positioning while letting your cores fight for you\u2014unleashing devastating autonomous attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/dc6da89371ef3a4947463ff597303b45.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/dc6da89371ef3a4947463ff597303b45.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/dc6da89371ef3a4947463ff597303b45.mp4?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and merge your Yokai-infused talismans. Strengthen them further by embedding powerful banners into their very fabric, enhancing your combat potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/723d47d4ac7a466794c31af94de73bd5.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/723d47d4ac7a466794c31af94de73bd5.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/723d47d4ac7a466794c31af94de73bd5.mp4?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse different abilities to reshape your gameplay! Sacrifice one skill to create a legendary enhanced ability\u2014turning the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/598100af5f23a42f30fbe02256d51151.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=432 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/598100af5f23a42f30fbe02256d51151.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy a Talisman and Banner Pack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open new talisman and banner packs to transform your playstyle. Experiment with fresh builds and break through enemies you couldn\u2019t defeat before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/89dd5a273c32d46cc4e676465df6cbbf.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/89dd5a273c32d46cc4e676465df6cbbf.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your pouch with the right talismans and banners\u2014these will be crucial for harnessing the power of Yokai Cores. Choose wisely, as your survival depends on it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the swing. Fuel your power with speed. Craft builds that make every run your own. Add Momento Pole to your wishlist today and prepare to carve your path through chaos.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Momento Pole, your movement is your greatest weapon.</strong> Master pole-swinging momentum to position yourself, escape swarms, and unleash devastating speed-powered attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget standing still. Every attack, every dodge, every kill is driven by how you move. Build speed to power up skills, grab poles to unleash charged abilities, and chain movement into deadly combos. With every run, experiment with unique skill combinations, talisman setups, and character momentum abilities that make no two battles alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/2e8a8ec4f361ecce64e45e473b8ee9e0.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/2e8a8ec4f361ecce64e45e473b8ee9e0.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/2e8a8ec4f361ecce64e45e473b8ee9e0.mp4?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement-Combat Fusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed isn\u2019t just for dodging \u2014 it\u2019s your ammo, your trigger, your damage multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/69ca2c7b2c538a87c437853cc2b3606d.poster.avif?t=1755053415\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618900/extras/69ca2c7b2c538a87c437853cc2b3606d.webm?t=1755053415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so